<title>SPAIN: Spain March producer prices rose 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain March producer prices rose 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		  MARCH 97	FEB 97   MARCH 96</p>
<p> Pct change on month		0.1	  -0.1	 -0.2</p>
<p> Pct change on year		 0.8	   0.5	  1.9</p>
